        <h1>Defining the Relationship Between Biomarkers of Oxidative and Inflammatory Stress and the Risk for Atherosclerosis in Astronauts During and After Long-duration Spaceflight</h1>
        <div class="meta-id">Record ID: Cardio_Ox</div>
